For this daemon to work, your pf.conf must call the 'miniupnpd' anchor.
5BSD runs OpenBSD PF: there is no separate NAT section or rdr-anchor;
miniupnpd loads its rdr-to and pass rules into one ordinary anchor.
Example:

# uPnPd anchor (redirections and filter rules)
anchor "miniupnpd"
